# SEC Fundamentals Warehouse - Massachusetts public companies

A DuckDB star-schema warehouse of financial statements for ${companies} Massachusetts-headquartered public companies, built from SEC EDGAR XBRL data, with ${n_checks} SQL data-quality checks and a generated report.

**Headline:** return on equity in this group comes from three different places. In the latest fiscal year ${t1} leads at ${t1_roe} ROE mostly through leverage (equity multiplier ${t1_em}x, asset turnover ${t1_at}x); ${t2} reaches ${t2_roe} on a ${t2_nm} net margin by turning its assets over ${t2_at}x a year; ${bm} has the highest net margin (${bm_nm}) but a ${bm_roe} ROE because it carries little leverage (${bm_em}x). The median non-financial ROE is ${median_roe}.

![DuPont decomposition of ROE](output/charts/dupont_roe.png)

Full report: [`output/report.md`](output/report.md) (also [`output/report.html`](output/report.html)). Every table is also a CSV in [`output/tables/`](output/tables/).

